YOUR IMAGES, YOUR DATA

This application runs entirely in your browser.

  * Images you open with it are never uploaded. They are read by the page, used
    to seed a generation, and discarded when you close the tab. No copy is sent
    anywhere, because there is no server to send one to.

  * Nothing you type is transmitted. Prompts are turned into numbers on your own
    machine and given to a model that is also on your own machine.

  * Images the application generates are yours. The copyright holder claims no
    rights over the pictures you make with it, and makes no claim to inspect,
    store, or use them.

  * There is no account, no tracking, no analytics, and no cookie beyond what is
    needed to serve the page itself.

This section describes how the software behaves and is a statement of intent,
not a limitation of the rights reserved above.

