THIRD-PARTY WORK

This project ships no third-party code. The model is trained from scratch on
procedurally generated artwork created for it, so no third-party dataset,
checkpoint, or asset licence applies to anything in this repository.

PyTorch is used for training only and is not distributed with the application.
It is licensed separately by its own authors.
